cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EgoLens in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "EgoLens: A browser-based viewer for autonomous-driving datasets"
abstract: >-
  EgoLens is a zero-setup, browser-based viewer for the most widely used
  autonomous-driving datasets (Waymo Open Dataset v2, nuScenes, and
  Argoverse 2). It renders LiDAR point clouds, synchronized camera views,
  3D bounding boxes, trajectory trails, and semantic segmentation directly
  in the browser with no conversion or preprocessing, loading data from a
  local folder or a URL.
type: software
